      "message": "test: Check the first alert in `feature_versionbits_warning.py`\n\nThe node raises the unknown rules warning and runs `-alertnotify` as\nsoon as the unknown deployment becomes active, which happens before the\nrestart. Wait for the warning to appear in the alert file at that point.",
