          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/6315c7759296e6b113aed17bf17187ea3d8b8788"
        }
      ],
      "message": "test: Wait for the second alert in `feature_versionbits_warning.py`\n\nThe check at the end of the test was already satisfied by the output of\nthe first alert, so the test did not wait for the `-alertnotify` command\nrun after the restart. Empty the alert file while the node is down, so\nthat only the second alert can satisfy it.\n\nOn Windows, this narrows a race in which the test directory was removed\nwhile that command was still starting. The command keeps open the\nhandles it inherits from the node, which made the cleanup fail with\nWinError 32.",
      "committer": {
